  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Internal support for Compze.Tessaging's inbox; nothing public changes:** a unit of work whose transaction times out after a timeout its caller gives, where every unit of work's times out after 45 seconds, for the handlers whose registrations choose their transaction timeout.\n- **Documentation: on Linux, the synchronous `ExecuteUnitOfWork` over a server database waits for a free thread-pool thread for each answer,** so synchronous units of work on pool threads that block, waiting for one another, can stall one another's database calls for seconds, on Linux only. Its remarks now say so, and to run such work with `ExecuteUnitOfWorkAsync` there.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.14.0-internal (was 0.9.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.14.1-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
